OL,3,GNEWSA'I use Zumba to better the lives
OL,4,Aof my community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGrowing up in Istanbul, Zumba
OL,7,Finstructor Berna Akinal said for as
OL,8,Flong as she could remember she has
OL,9,Falways wanted to dance.
OL,11,FAfter moving to Norwich in 1984, she
OL,12,Fspent 25 years working as an accountant
OL,13,Fbefore she lost her job and took up the
OL,14,Fdance-fitness workout as a hobby.
OL,16,FIn 2012 Akinal obtained her licence to
OL,17,Fteach classes and later set up Team
OL,18,FBerna Zumba Club in Gorleston-on-Sea,
OL,19,FNorfolk, which now has 200 members and
OL,20,Fruns four classes a week.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
