OL,3,GNEWSA'I use Zumba to better the lives
OL,4,Aof my community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAkinal, who has been nominated for BBC
OL,7,FNorfolk Make a Difference Award, said:
OL,8,F"I use [Zumba] to better the lives of
OL,9,Fpeople in my community - I don't have
OL,10,Fchildren so the people who come to my
OL,11,Fclasses are my family."
